# Navigation UX Fix — Implementation Plan

## Summary

Based on two forensic audit passes, we have **7 confirmed, actionable fixes** across the codebase. No exploratory guesswork — every change below is tied to a verified file + line number. The scope is surgical: redirect logic, missing action buttons, and breadcrumb/backHref hardening. Zero UI redesign.

