## Proposed Changes

### Fix 1 — PRApprovalClient: Redirect to detail after approve/reject

#### [MODIFY] `PRApprovalClient.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/app/[locale]/(app)/(procurement)/purchase-requests/[id]/approve/PRApprovalClient.tsx`

- In `handleApprove` and `handleReject` `onSuccess` callbacks, change:
  ```diff
  - router.push('/purchase-requests');
  + router.push(`/purchase-requests/${id}`);
  ```
- The `id` is already available from `useParams()` or as a prop.

---

### Fix 2 — PODetailClient: Add "Convert to GRN" action button

#### [MODIFY] `PODetailClient.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/app/[locale]/(app)/(procurement)/purchase-orders/[id]/PODetailClient.tsx`

- Inside the `ActionGuard`/action section, add:
  ```tsx
  <ActionGuard documentType="PO" status={status} action="CONVERT_TO_GRN" role={user?.role}>
    <PermissionGate action="create" resource="grn">
      <Button
        onClick={() => router.push(`/goods-receipts/new?po_id=${id}`)}
        className="..."
      >
        <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4 me-2 rtl:rotate-180" />
        {t('convert_to_grn')}
      </Button>
    </PermissionGate>
  </ActionGuard>
  ```
- Requires adding `"CONVERT_TO_GRN"` to the PO document engine's allowed actions for `APPROVED` status.

---

### Fix 3 — AdjustmentCreateClient: Add `onSuccess` redirect + fix `onCancel`

#### [MODIFY] `AdjustmentCreateClient.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/app/[locale]/(app)/(operations)/adjustments/new/AdjustmentCreateClient.tsx`

- In the `createAdjustment.mutate(...)` call, add an `onSuccess` callback:
  ```diff
  + onSuccess: (data) => {
  +   router.push(`/adjustments/${data.id}`, { skipGuard: true });
  + }
  ```
- Change the cancel handler from `router.back()` to:
  ```diff
  - router.back()
  + router.push('/adjustments', { skipGuard: true })
  ```

---

### Fix 4 — MasterDataFormLayout: Honor the `backHref` prop

#### [MODIFY] `MasterDataFormLayout.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/components/shared/MasterDataFormLayout.tsx`

- The component receives `backHref` but never uses it in the back button's `onClick`. Fix:
  ```diff
  - onClick={() => router.back()}
  + onClick={() => backHref ? router.push(backHref) : router.back()}
  ```
  This is a one-line fix; all existing callers that pass `backHref` will instantly benefit.

---

### Fix 5 — KitchenRequestFormClient: Fix `onCancel` navigation

#### [MODIFY] `KitchenRequestFormClient.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/app/[locale]/(app)/(operations)/kitchen-requests/new/KitchenRequestFormClient.tsx`

- Change cancel handler from `router.back()` to an explicit path:
  ```diff
  - onCancel={() => router.back()}
  + onCancel={() => router.push('/kitchen-requests', { skipGuard: true })}
  ```

