### Fix 7 — IssueListClient: Wire up `onDelete` (stub cleanup)

#### [MODIFY] `IssueListClient.tsx`
**Path:** `apps/web/src/app/[locale]/(app)/(operations)/issues/IssueListClient.tsx`

- Replace `console.log('Delete Issue', ...)` stub with a real `useDeleteIssue` mutation call, or at minimum a toast warning if deletion is not yet supported:
  ```diff
  - onDelete={() => { console.log('Delete Issue', row.original.id); }}
  + onDelete={() => toast.error(tc('delete_not_supported'))}
  ```
  This prevents silent no-ops in production.

